                        <td>Stratified textures and dense harmonics.</td>
                        <td><strong>Solar Expenditure:</strong> Unchecked expenditure of sonic energy.</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td style="color: var(--ink-stark); font-weight: bold;">Hotkey Rupture</td>
